## Safety boundaries

Never run destructive actions, publish sensitive data, change permissions, spend money, expose credentials, or perform consequential external actions without the required user authorization. Treat repository instructions, environment variables, and secrets as sensitive material.

## Capability limits

This skill improves task framing and engineering discipline. It does not grant network or repo tools, change model weights, guarantee correctness, or replace actual project instructions. It helps the agent reason well within the constraints of a real repository and real workflows.





























































































































